<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model area conservation, and solar-elevation ray tracing of tiered crowns vs latitude — Code-to-model traceability: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module docstring (L1-60) maps every governing equation to Honda (1971), Honda & Fisher (1978), Fisher & Honda (1979), Shinozaki (1964), Eloy (2011) and, for Pass 3, Campbell & Norman (1998), Cooper (1969) and Monsi & Saeki (1953), and names the 5 Lean theorems with line ranges; each solar function docstring cites its equation (L498-692). The math-KG YAML registers laws 1-5 with refreshed code loci. Deductions: the 3D builder's pitch/roll constants (L221-222, L239) and `gravity_droop_k`, the tier-order schedule (L586), LAI_c = 2 (L1215), the CV percentiles (L850, L871) and the foliage threshold (L801) are stated but not sourced (-4); `_shift_mask` integer-pixel quantisation of the shadow displacement (L629-640) is not documented as a <= 1-cell error (-1); the docstring's Lean pin \"L130-L166\" refers to the comment block, the theorem itself starts at L150 (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py L586–L586: Tier-order schedule max(2, 5 - 4t//n) is an unsourced modelling choice <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py#L586-L586>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model area conservation, and solar-elevation ray tracing of tiered crowns vs latitude — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
