        "datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/dichotomous_tree_branching_reference.json L46–L103: honda_fisher_1978_angle_sweep_benchmarks values (0.2001, 0.7591, 0.7739, ...) are the script's own outputs, not digitised Honda & Fisher (1978) figure values; r = 0.9978 is self-referential <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/dichotomous_tree_branching_reference.json#L46-L103>" ;
