<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model area conservation, and solar-elevation ray tracing of tiered crowns vs latitude — Source and data traceability: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Vendors `datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/` with 5 BibTeX entries and DOIs in `paper_citations.bib`, `scout_manifest.json`, the reference JSON and the specimen JPEG, all SHA-256-verified at runtime (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L103-118), and Pass 3 adds `solar_tier_spacing_reference.json` pinned via `EXPECTED_SHA256_PASS3` / `load_solar_reference` (L98-100, L120-123), `solar_citations_pass3.bib` with Campbell & Norman (1998), Cooper (1969) and Monsi & Saeki (1953), and a \"Pass 3 additions\" README section with the SHA-256 and the headline numbers. Deductions: `solar_citations_pass3.bib` is a separate file and is not SHA-256-pinned (the original bib is pinned, hence untouched) (-2); the three new DOIs were not verified online in this offline round (-1); the reference JSON labels the script's own outputs as \"Honda & Fisher 1978 benchmarks\", so the provenance of the central benchmark curve is mis-stated at source (-3); no literature value exists for tier spacing vs latitude, stated honestly (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/dichotomous_tree_branching_reference.json L46–L103: Benchmark block named after Honda & Fisher (1978) but holding script-generated values <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/datasets/dichotomous_tree_branching/dichotomous_tree_branching_reference.json#L46-L103>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-source-traceability-1>,
